<title>USA: Wake County, N.C., $100 mln GOs won by Goldman.</title>
<headline>Wake County, N.C., $100 mln GOs won by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it won $100 million Wake County, N.C., general obligation school bonds at a net interest cost of 4.909 percent.</p>
